1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 4 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
81 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,800
…and 62 of them
are from Mats!

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,200
He calls himself
"the town comment spammer"!

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,200
He wants a comment
spam contest…

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,800
…but he already won!

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
Still, that's
€124 for the town!

8
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Yesterday: 89 residents.

9
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,300
Today, we are 98!

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,400
That brings
€9,176 into the budget!

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,500
UserFromRO gets
a house with an M5!

12
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,800
Salih gets
a villa!

13
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,100
Sanulatesade gets
a house!

14
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,000
cnaaitsirh, Iain and Bob:
your homes come next!

15
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,000
Thomas wanted
a fence and a basketball court…

16
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,400
Done!

17
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,400
Kalilay, Camille and 5 more
move into the apartment block!

18
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,000
Welcome Ayalneh and Lerato!

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,000
doodle
wants to be president too!

20
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,200
The election has
5 candidates now!

21
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,800
Divish and Alex
have 1 vote each!

22
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,800
Reply with a name
to vote!

23
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,800
"D bucks", doodle?

24
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,000
Sorry, Leoville pays
in euros!

25
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,200
A revolution, Barhoum?

26
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,400
Leoville has no king…
yet!

27
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,000
Mats is lonely
in the robot house…

28
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,400
Who wants to
move in with Mats?

29
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,800
And what do you
want next?

30
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,200
Military Base and school
are tied!

31
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:12,700
The school costs
€120,000.

32
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,900
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

33
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,300
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

34
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,800
Who should lead
Leoville?

35
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:22,200
Vote in the
comments!
